ay of 2021 he doesn't expect a  truck before the end of 2023 maybe even  spilling to 20.4 by the time these  things hit the market it's already a  long waiting list for them and that's  the problem if concerns about  fluctuating gas prices leads you to  purchase an ev today you're not actually  protecting yourself from today's gas  prices you're effectively taking a  gamble on what gas prices might be in  nine months to two years or whenever you  get to drive the thing so figuring out  if it could really save you money might  require a crystal ball  hey do you know why it's called a  monroney sticker it's named after a u.s  politician called mike monroney who  sponsored a 1958 act requiring retail  price and other information to be  displayed on all new cars so now you  know and if you want to know more don't  forget to subscribe see you soon

